<title>USA: Enron Oil names Enron officer to board.</title>
<headline>Enron Oil names Enron officer to board.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enron Oil &amp; Gas Co said Monday its directors elected Edmund P. Segner III to the company's board, effective January 1.</p>
<p>Segner, executive vice president and chief of staff at Enron Corp, replaces Richard D. Kinder, formerly president of Enron, who resigned from the Enron Oil board effective December 31.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
